title: "nds-mcp: Nuclear Data Services MCP server"
abstract: "Offline SQLite-backed MCP server for nuclear data: AME2020 masses, NUBASE2020 properties and decay, charge radii, ENSDF levels/gammas/feedings, TUNL light nuclei, JENDL-5 cross sections and spectra, EXFOR points, and CODATA constants, with source-tagged values."
